- I've been thinking about names.

15
00:00:43,939 --> 00:00:48,439
(Leonard:)I'm kind of torn between Einstein,
Newton and Sergeant Fuzzy Boots.

16
00:00:48,944 --> 00:00:51,734
Do you think you can satisfy
your need for a relationship...

17
00:00:51,906 --> 00:00:54,116
(Sheldon:)...with a genetically altered cat?

18
00:00:54,283 --> 00:00:58,123
(Leonard:)Maybe, if it's a cute little cuddly cat.

